- get current channel information.

##### Request URL
- ` http://app.divoom-gz.com/Channel/Get5LcdInfoV2 `

##### Request method
- POST 

##### para

|Name|DATA TYPE|DESCRIPTION|
|:----    |:----- |-----   |
|DeviceId |Number |the device id  |
|DeviceType |string |"LCD"  |


