##### Return value 

|Name|DATA TYPE|DESCRIPTION|
|:-----  |:-----|-----                           |
|error_code |number   |0  |
|ChannelType |number   |current seleced item; 0:whole dial; 1:indepence dial  |
|ClockId |number   |the whole dial id  |
|LcdIndependence |number   |the selected indepence dial id  |
|LcdIndependenceList |array   |the indepence dial list  |
|LcdIndependence |number   |the indepence dial id  |
|LcdList |array   |the sub items in the indepence dial  |
|LcdClockId |number   |the sub dial id; it is active if LcdSelectIndex is 0 and it comes from sub dial list |

You can use adb to push files to the device so that local files can be used on custom dials

The requested URL is  "IP:9000/divoom_api" (http://192.168.13.109:9000/divoom_api);
The method is "GET"；
the body is below:
{
    "Command":"Channel/OnOffScreen",
    "OnOff": 1
}
